      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#24211E] mb-1.5">Processing Failed</h3>
      <p id="error-message" class="text-xs text-[#736B61] mb-5">Something went wrong while processing the image.</p>
      <button
        id="error-retry-btn"
